{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_page", "label": "Schema-Registry", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistry", "label": "SchemaRegistry (Interface)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_inmemoryschemaregistry", "label": "InMemorySchemaRegistry", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Optionaler Katalog f\u00fcr Codebases mit 10+ Event-Typen; h\u00e4lt den gesamten State in einem Prozess, register mutiert an Ort und Stelle und gibt void zur\u00fcck."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistration", "label": "SchemaRegistration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_register", "label": "register(manifest, version, registration)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_eventadapter", "label": "registry.eventAdapter(manifest)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Schreibt bei der neuesten Version und liest jede \u00e4ltere Version desselben Manifests, indem es die registrierten Upcaster nach vorne verkettet."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_snapshotadapter", "label": "registry.snapshotAdapter(manifest)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_zodcodec", "label": "zodCodec", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_serializercodec", "label": "serializerCodec", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verpackt jeden Serializer, damit jede Version ein anderes Wire-Format nutzen kann; kodiert zu { serializerId, manifest, bytes }, die Bytes werden genau einmal base64-kodiert."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_one_adapter_one_manifest", "label": "Ein Adapter, ein Manifest", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ohne die Pr\u00fcfung w\u00fcrde ein fremder Frame sauber durch den anderen Codec dekodieren und einem statisch anders typisierten Aufrufer ein falsches Objekt zur\u00fcckgeben; auf einem Recovery-Pfad landet damit ein fremdes Event in onEvent und erzeugt State, den es nie gab. Realistischer Ausl\u00f6ser ist Fehlverdrahtung, kein Angreifer."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_multi_manifest_actor_limit", "label": "Ein Actor mit mehreren Manifesten kann keinen Registry-Adapter verwenden", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "toJournal taggt jedes Event mit dem einen Manifest; der Lesepfad ist fr\u00fcher stillschweigend fehlgeschlagen und schl\u00e4gt jetzt laut fehl. Stattdessen ein fromJournal schreiben, das auf stored.manifest verzweigt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_compatibility_checks", "label": "Kompatibilit\u00e4ts-Checks (none / backward / sample)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pr\u00fcft zur Register-Zeit, dass eine neue Version die vorherige noch lesen kann; 'sample' f\u00e4hrt zus\u00e4tzlich einen Round-Trip dekodieren-upcasten-neu-enkodieren und erwischt latente Upcaster-Bugs vor dem Deploy."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_per_version_wire_format", "label": "Ein bin\u00e4res Wire-Format pro Version", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die einzige Stelle, an der ein Formatwechsel pro Version geht \u2014 das withSerializer eines Stores gilt storeweit."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_serializer_id_mismatch", "label": "serializerId reist mit der Zeile mit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Macht eine Verwechslung laut, statt still zu Unsinn zu dekodieren \u2014 bei Avro (keine Feld-Tags) und Protobuf (kein Nachrichtenname) der Normalfall, wenn man ihnen fremde Bytes gibt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_not_a_remote_registry", "label": "Keine Remote-/HTTP-Schema-Registry", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keine Remote-Subject-Versionierung und keine Kompatibilit\u00e4ts-Aushandlung \u00fcber die Leitung \u2014 au\u00dferhalb des Scopes f\u00fcr v1; das strukturelle Schema liegt trotzdem hier, erzwungen auf Lesen und Schreiben."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_per_deployment", "label": "Die Registry gilt per Deployment", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/schema-registry.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unterschiedliche Versionen zwischen Umgebungen spiegeln sich im deployten Code wider, nicht in verschiedenen Laufzeit-Registries."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_inmemoryschemaregistry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_schema_registry_schemaregistry", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content